# LF everywhere, on every OS (24 Nov 2026): a Windows checkout with CRLF must
# compile to the same bytes as a Linux one (reproducible releases).
* text=auto eol=lf
# Vendored ESP-IDF components: byte-exact, so their CHECKSUMS.json / .component_hash still verify
components/espressif__*/** -text
components/joltwallet__*/** -text
